ime si riuniscono per preparare i cioccolatini per il resto del gruppo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m2BrIb8pUdFQcdxjuHWJQjvDYY6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"30170","synopsis":"Part A: The winter is almost over. The gang divide themselves into two teams and play snowball but Mayoi and Sakaki have some tricks up their sleeves.\n\nPart B: Cooking class. In a different team than Io, Tsumiki takes the opportunity to show him her culinary skills.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iv1emy4X586Ws29OQE0GQHvXPp8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Part A: The winter is almost over. The gang divide themselves into two teams and play snowball but Mayoi and Sakaki have some tricks up their sleeves.\n\nPart B: Cooking class. In a different team than Io, Tsumiki takes the opportunity to show him her culinary skills.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iv1emy4X586Ws29OQE0GQHvXPp8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"30166","synopsis":"Part A: Due to a 