ee girls. After the test, the weather turns rainy and there are not enough umbrellas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLxfIpMwTuoW0HITeUTV4qgpxot.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"30171","synopsis":"Although summer homework is still waiting for them to finish, except for Io, the five decide to take a train trip to a mountain resort. In the Drift race, they race to the mountain resort, and race along the mountain in a parody of Initial D.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hpIY6CdDcKsNgzikaKCemtvXRt.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Although summer homework is still waiting for them to finish, except for Io, the five decide to take a train trip to a mountain resort. In the Drift race, they race to the mountain resort, and race along the mountain in a parody of Initial D.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hpIY6CdDcKsNgzikaKCemtvXRt.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"30165","synopsis":"Part A: The girls decide to pay a visit to Io's place as 