mdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"The time comes for the school festival and the five decide to mount a crêpe stand (named \"Tsutsumin!\" meaning something like \"I wrapped\") together, which turns out to be a great success. Io serves as the cook but also sews Tsumiki's mascot uniform by hand, and promises the first crêpe to her. Mayoi wears no lab coat over her waitress uniform.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4q9MVqfRPNV2EYq4DURwnu9BTKO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"30169","synopsis":"Part A: Mayoi buys a bear costume for cheap and decides to put it to use by scaring as many people as she can.\n\nPart B: Mayoi is planning to have a party on Christmas Eve but has to put it off to Christmas Day as Hime and Io promised to work in Hatch Potch. She and Tsumiki also stand in to help Io sell Christmas cakes in front of the shop.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v4vo8uMaZk3WIpMOm8LNRnhzDhn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Part A: Mayoi buys a bear costume for cheap and decides to put it to use by scaring as many people as she can.\n\nPart B: Mayoi is planning to have a party on Christmas Eve but has to put it off to Christmas Day as Hime and Io promised to work in Hatch Potch. She and Tsumiki also stand in to help Io sell Christmas cakes in front of the shop.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v4vo8uMaZk3WIpMOm8LNRnhzDhn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"30176","synopsis":"Part A: The five go to the New Year's festival. The following day, they come together at the Inuis' place where their teacher Kikue Sakuragawa, who seems to be Miiko's friend, is also present. They talk about new year's resolutions, play games, and have a meal.\n\nPart B: It's a very cold day. Due to a flu epidemic, more than half the class is absent, school finishes after lunch. Tsumiki and Io appear to have a 'moment' which leaves Io rather confused and flustered.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nptwKSgaeG0zpz0L1JsICLRN522.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Part A: The five go to the New Year's festival. The following day, they come together at the Inuis' place where their teacher Kikue Sakuragawa, who seems to be Miiko's friend, is also present. They talk about new year's resolutions, play games, and have a meal.\n\nPart B: It's a very cold day. Due to a flu epidemic, more than half the class is absent, school finishes after lunch. Tsumiki and Io appear to have a 'moment' which leaves Io rather confused and flustered.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nptwKSgaeG0zpz0L1JsICLRN522.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"30173","synopsis":"Part A: It's valentine's day and the girls decide to make some chocolates, at school Tsumiki forgot the chocolates she wanted to give to Io. Everybody was having fun trading chocolates except Tsumiki. After school, Tsumiki runs back to her house to get the chocolate, but on the way back the chocolates got wet and then Io arrives with his umbrella to protect Tsumiki from the rain. Even when the chocolates were all wet, Io still accepted the chocolates.\n\nPart B: It's White Day and the boys (inclusive Kyoya) decide to make chocolate marshmallow, white chocolate cookies and gem sweets as return for the chocolates at valentine's day. Sakaki has secretly made some pig feet marshmallows as revenge for Mayoi's frog-flesh chocolate (episode 2, but it backfires before the end). At the end Io and Tsumiki talked about the kittyface on Tsumiki's gem sweetbox that Io has specially made for her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wgZIJTfC3DwFTzSRBRfWy5UZmSQ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Part A: It's valentine's day and the girls decide to make some chocolates, at school Tsumiki forgot the chocolates she wanted to give to Io. Everybody was having fun trading chocolates except Tsumiki. After school, Tsumiki runs back to her house to get the chocolate, but on the way back the chocolates got wet and then Io arrives with his umbrella to protect Tsumiki from the rain. Even when the chocolates were all wet, Io still accepted the chocolates.\n\nPart B: It's White Day and the boys (inclusive Kyoya) decide to make chocolate marshmallow, white chocolate cookies and gem sweets as return for the chocolates at valentine's day. Sakaki has secretly made some pig feet marshmallows as revenge for Mayoi's frog-flesh chocolate (episode 2, but it backfires before the end). At the end Io and Tsumiki talked about the kittyface on Tsumiki's gem sweetbox that Io has specially made for her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wgZIJTfC3DwFTzSRBRfWy5UZmSQ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:12291","mal:12291"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8890","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12291","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"12291","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nobW89qmqe1YClDLwBXuOzmmEqv.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt2309934/img"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/257888/clearlogo/611cfcd7ea5c8.png"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/257888/clearlogo/611cfcdad1b6e.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2847va2BTHfrpcZXKVNPfl33tl5.jpg"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/257888-3.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx12291-NKo7qYW674Wo.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt2309934/img"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12291-NKo7qYW674Wo.jpg"}],"background":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6pYJ1Vk3WSTFuEUNPuw4xJQ6Vdk.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt2309934/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/257888-3.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https:/